'''Sharpshooter Saki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.3 Update|Version 9.3]] and can be unlocked from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]] targets Relic and Aliens alongside [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]], and [[Ultra Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]].

